00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:21.280
back to that scheduling example which is

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:25.000
kinda like the- like the granddaddy of all the big,

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.340
ah, flaw of averages problems.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:32.810
Um, so here I've got

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:41.470
