00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:20.620
So I'll add the first die to the second die and now,

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:25.555
what I'm doing is I'm doing arithmetic with uncertainty.

00:09:25.555 --> 00:09:28.210
Now, when I add two dice, the smallest number you can get is a two.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.800
The biggest number you can get is a 12.

